<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate & Commerce Disclosure — Vigorix Prime"
  description="Vigorix Prime is reader-supported, uses affiliate links, and also sells its own Health Care products. Here is exactly how we keep the two apart."
  path="/affiliate-disclosure"
>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="container page-wrap">
      <h1>Affiliate &amp; Commerce Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: 2026</p>

      <p>Vigorix Prime (vigorixprime.com) is reader-supported. To keep our reviews free and our research independent, we use affiliate links throughout the site, and we also sell a small range of Health Care products ourselves. This page explains exactly what that means for you.</p>

      <h2>We Sell Our Own Products</h2>
      <p>Alongside the reviews, we run a small shop at <a href="/shop">vigorixprime.com/shop</a> offering our own Health Care range — items such as herbal warming patches, knee support braces and similar everyday comfort products. When you buy one of those, the money comes to us directly rather than as a commission from another retailer. That is a different relationship from the rest of the site, so we handle it in a deliberately visible way:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Our own products are labelled "Our product"</strong> everywhere they appear — on the homepage, in the shop, and on the product page itself.</li>
        <li><strong>They are never reviewed, scored or ranked by our editorial team.</strong> You will not find them in any "Best…" guide, in the comparison tables, or in the Editor's Best Picks section — not at the top, and not anywhere else on the list.</li>
        <li><strong>They sit in their own category ("Health Care").</strong> They are not filed under Supplements, Performance, Vitality or Grooming, which are editorial review categories.</li>
        <li><strong>They are excluded from our structured data.</strong> The machine-readable rankings and review markup we publish for our guides describe only independently assessed third-party products.</li>
        <li>Where a guide and one of our products cover related ground, we may link to it from a clearly separated block at the end of the article, marked as our own and outside the ranking.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>In short: if we sell it, we do not rank it. If we rank it, we do not sell it.</p>

      <h2>Amazon Associates Program</h2>
      <p>Vigorix Prime is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. When you click an Amazon link on our site and make a qualifying purchase, we may receive a small commission.</p>

      <h2>What This Costs You</h2>
      <p>Nothing. Affiliate commissions are paid by the retailer, not by you. You pay the same price whether you reach a product through one of our links or by visiting the store directly. The commission simply helps fund the time we spend researching and maintaining our guides.</p>

      <h2>Other Affiliate Partners</h2>
      <p>In addition to Amazon, we may participate in other affiliate and advertising programs with retailers and brands relevant to men's supplements, performance products and grooming gear. In every case, the same standards apply: links are added for products we believe are worth your consideration.</p>

      <h2>How It Affects Our Reviews</h2>
      <p>It doesn't change our verdicts. We rank and recommend products based on their merits — ingredient quality, dosing, effectiveness, value and suitability for different goals. A product does not earn a higher position because it pays a larger commission, and we regularly recommend options that earn us little or nothing when they are genuinely the best choice. If we ever cannot recommend a product, we will not feature it just to place a link.</p>

      <h2>Pricing and Availability</h2>
      <p>Prices, availability and product formulations change frequently. Any figures mentioned on our site are accurate to the best of our knowledge at the time of writing but should be confirmed on the retailer's page before you buy.</p>

      <h2>Not Medical Advice</h2>
      <p>Our reviews of supplements and health products are for general information only and are not medical advice. Always read the product label and consult a qualified healthcare professional before adding a new supplement or health product to your routine.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If anything here is unclear, please reach out through our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page. We're happy to explain how we operate.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us by Email</h2>
      <p>You can also reach us directly by email:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>General questions &amp; feedback: <a href="mailto:info@vigorixprime.com">info@vigorixprime.com</a></li>
        <li>Advertising &amp; affiliate partnerships: <a href="mailto:affiliate@vigorixprime.com">affiliate@vigorixprime.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
